(Warm/Cold/Precise) and AlignedWideBits16 (Hot baseline). The
forward-looking entries are revised:

- **UFixed / IFixed at 129..=65535 logical width.** Awaits UArith /
  IArith dispatch on `WideBits<BYTES>` / `AlignedWideBits16<BYTES>`
